re that, the free demo is part of Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. If you've been waiting to try the game, fest week is a great time, and if you've already played, the demo is the same one your coworkers haven't discovered yet.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:30:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1839676055895061","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"Remain At Your Desk is part of Steam's Cyberpunk Fest (new trailer inside)","summary":"Remain At Your Desk is part of Steam's Cyberpunk Fest, running now through August 10. There's a new trailer for the occasion, and the free demo is live on this page.It's an incremental cyberpunk game where you fake work by day and hack your corrupt company at night. Steal corporate secrets and sell them, or keep them for leverage while suspicion climbs. Climb the corporate ladder, but if you push too far you could be fired...or worse.A note from your employer:\"RAYND Corporation congratulates Ste","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T15:26:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1836506165554455","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"New feature: ORIGINS RPG Choice!","summary":"Before your first shift you now fill out RAYND's personnel intake form and pick who you used to be! Three to choose from: The Lifer. Twenty years in the building, so nobody looks twice at you. You've also gone rusty at the actual hacking.The Plant. Someone planted you here with a handler and funding, so you're quick and you came in loaded. The downside is you stick out.The Debtor. RAYND owns your debt. Everything pays better, but you start in the hole and they garnish your pay until it's clear. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T15:59:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1835236783560840","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Night Events, Morale Break Fix, FPS Limit Setting","summary":"Thanks to everyone who has been playing the demo and sending feedback! Night Shift- Added 7 new night events- Added 5 new interrogation questions, so audits repeat far less often- Events no longer repeat back to back. Every event in the pool now plays once before any of them can appear againMorale Break- Fixed the ball physics. The ball could pass through the paddle or clip through bricks during frame drops, especially at higher waves. Collision is now checked in smaller steps so this can no lon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T15:44:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1835236783557242","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Playable on Mac, Plus Italian Support","summary":"The demo is now on MacRemain At Your Desk is now playable on macOS. It's a universal build that runs natively on both Apple Silicon and Intel Macs, and it's signed and notarized, so it opens cleanly with no Gatekeeper hoops. Now in Italian The build also adds full Italian language support, joining the languages already available. Benvenuti. Grab the free demo on Windows or Mac, and wishlist Remain At Your Desk to follow it to the full release.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T11:15:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557242","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1834602721190635","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"New Opening Sequence, Morale Break 2.0, and Polish Localization","summary":"A New Cold Open I've replaced the opening sequence with something that gets to the point a little faster. The game now opens with a quarterly performance report from RAYND Corporation celebrating its 47th consecutive quarter of record growth. Workforce efficiency is up. Profits are up. Everything appears to be going exactly according to plan. The goal was to bring the mystery to the front of the game instead of asking players to wait for it. Morale Break 2.0 Morale Break started life as a small ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T13:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721190635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1833968530888851","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"update","title":"REMAIN AT YOUR DESK Update + Programming Fest + Vietnamese Localization","summary":"Big week for REMAIN AT YOUR DESK. The game was officially accepted into Steam Programming Fest 2026 this September, alongside Cyberpunk Fest in August. Really excited to see the game connecting with both the cyberpunk crowd and the programming/systems-heavy audience at the same time. Also: Vietnamese localization has now been added to the game. Huge thank you to everyone continuing to send screenshots, bug reports, wording notes, and weird edge cases from different regions and monitor setups. A ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T17:01:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1833334318580243","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"REMAIN AT YOUR DESK Accepted into Steam Cyberpunk Fest 2026","summary":"REMAIN AT YOUR DESK has officially been accepted into Steam Cyberpunk Fest 2026. As a solo developer, this honestly means a lot to me. When I started building a game about surviving inside a surveillance-heavy megacorporation, I had no idea whether the blend of incremental systems, terminal hacking, corporate paranoia, and dystopian sci-fi would resonate with people. Seeing Steam recognize the game as part of Cyberpunk Fest is a huge milestone. Since the Steam page launched in April, the respons","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T19:37:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318580243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1832700592800862","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"The Remain At Your Desk Demo Is Live!","summary":"Hi everyone! The demo is finally live, and I'm excited to share it with you. REMAIN AT YOUR DESK is an incremental hacker about faking productivity while stealing from your corrupt employer. It runs about 35 to 50 minutes and takes you through your third promotion. There's a new announcement trailer up on the store page too. If you end up enjoying it, here's what genuinely helps me right now: -Wishlisting the full game. I know it sounds small, but for a solo dev it's the single biggest signal St","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T12:37:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592800862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1832065502822785","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"Remain At Your Desk Demo Releases on May 19th on Steam!","summary":"I'm excited to share that the demo will be released on Tuesday, May 19th! Everyone's been so helpful with playtest feedback in the games Discord channel (which you can and should join!) On demo release day, if you'd be so kind as to play the demo, wishlist if you haven't already but also share about the game on social media, it'd be greatly appreciated! I can't wait for you all to check it out.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T02:54:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502822785","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1831432155565177","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"update","title":"Localization update brings six new languages to REMAIN AT YOUR DESK","summary":"For the practical side of things the game now picks your system language on first launch and falls back to English whenever a key is missing, which is the safest default I could come up with for languages that get partial coverage in future updates. You can swap languages at any time from the settings menu without losing your save or your prestige history, and the switch happens immediately so you can preview the translations across different sections of the UI without restarting the game. Chine","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T13:44:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155565177","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1830797770240285","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Discord & Playtest!","summary":"Join the REMAIN AT YOUR DESK discord here! I am intending to have the demo of REMAIN AT YOUR DESK on Steam in June/July ahead of Cyberpunk Fest in August. Right now I need as much feedback as I can on the current build to help make the game better. That's where you come in! Come join the discord server and help shape the future of this game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T14:47:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770240285","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1830797770231819","game_id":"steam-4546470","kind":"update","title":"Leverage mechanic update: every hack is now a choice","summary":"Leverage: Every Hack Is Now a Choice For the last week I've been quietly rebuilding what happens when you complete a hack. The short version: it used to be \"+N credits\" and a sound effect but I've changed it so it's now a decision, and a story. The Mechanic Every hack you complete now extracts Leverage : a specific piece of corporate dirt on the target system: \"The exec bathroom code is the company's founding year because of course it is.\" \"A vote to be held on 'workforce optimization.' They did","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-22T23:18:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770231819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546470-1830163047266539","game_id":